    "title": "Belfast Telegraph, 8 August 1934, p. 4 (\"Kilkeel nominations: the new town commissioners\"); Frontier Sentinel, 11 August 1934, p. 5 (\"Frontier items\"); Newry Reporter, 4 September 1934, p. 5 (\"Kilkeel Town Commissioners: first meeting\")",
